{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And expired.</b> Rashi's comment: the term גויעה is used only for the righteous. But there is the generation of the flood — we speak of גויעה and gathering together. And there is Ishmael, in whom גויעה and gathering are written — he did repentance, a servant's repentance, and Esau too did a servant's repentance. <b>And expired</b> — this is the departure of the spirit from the body without pain or hindrance. And in every גויעה there is death, but not in every death is there גויעה; therefore for the flood גויעה is written. <b>And was gathered to his people.</b> He walked in the ways of his fathers and was joined to them."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:46.135640064Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}